---
const WA = "https://wa.me/551194708842?text=Ol%C3%A1%20Academia!%20Quero%20saber%20mais%20e%20come%C3%A7ar%20a%20treinar.";
---
<section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden pt-[64px]">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?q=80&w=1920&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover opacity-[0.38]" loading="eager" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0A0A0A]/20 via-[#0A0A0A]/55 to-[#0A0A0A]"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0A0A0A]/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[760px]">
      <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-white backdrop-blur">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#F97316]"></span> SANTO ANDRÉ • PARQUE DAS NAÇÕES
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-[40px] sm:text-[54px] lg:text-[68px] font-black leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.02em] text-white" style="font-family: Oswald, sans-serif">
        TRANSFORME<br/>
        <span class="text-[#DC2626]">CORPO</span> E MENTE
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[640px] text-[17px] sm:text-[18px] leading-7 text-zinc-200">
        Treino com método, acompanhamento de verdade e estrutura feita para você evoluir — do primeiro dia ao seu melhor shape.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href={WA} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex h-[52px] px-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#DC2626] hover:bg-[#B91C1C] text-white font-extrabold tracking-wide text-[15px] transition shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(220,38,38,.35)]">Entrar em contato</a>
        <a href="#planos" class="inline-flex h-[52px] px-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 text-white font-bold backdrop-blur">Ver planos</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-200"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F97316]"></span> Avaliação orientada</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-200"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F97316]"></span> Professores presentes no salão</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-200"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F97316]"></span> Av. Brasil, 403 — Santo André</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 max-w-[560px] divide-x divide-white/10 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur overflow-hidden">
        <div class="px-4 py-4 text-center"><div class="text-xl font-black text-white" style="font-family: Oswald, sans-serif">+2.500</div><div class="text-xs tracking-wide text-zinc-400">ALUNOS ATIVOS</div></div>
        <div class="px-4 py-4 text-center"><div class="text-xl font-black text-white" style="font-family: Oswald, sans-serif">12+</div><div class="text-xs tracking-wide text-zinc-400">MODALIDADES</div></div>
        <div class="px-4 py-4 text-center"><div class="text-xl font-black text-white" style="font-family: Oswald, sans-serif">6h–22h</div><div class="text-xs tracking-wide text-zinc-400">SEG A SÁB</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
